            ^"Abilities" STRING "Animal Handling 1 (griffons), Area Lore 4 (home territory), Area Lore 1 (gold rich territory), Athletics 5+2 (flight), Awareness 5 (prey), Brawl 5 (claws), Hunt 4 (horses), Second Sight 3 (Illusions), Survival 4 (home terrain). +2 Athletics (female) included."
            ^"Vis" STRING "3 of Animal, heart"
